#. <CLT 4>そっと、体育館の中を覗き込んだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I didn't make a sound as I opened the door to the\n"
"gym...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>すると、音はさらに激しさを増す。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The sounds coming from inside, meanwhile,\n"
"only intensified that much more.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「ガガッ…バギッ…！」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Kacha! Bakyu!*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「ガガガッ！！　ドカッ！　バキッ！！」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Hagagya! Hiya! Paching!*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「バキャ！　ドドドッ！　スババババババッ！！」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Bakya! Dadadun! Shashashasha!*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>目の前で繰り広げられる人間離れしたバトル…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Before me there raged a battle beyond anything humanly\n"
"possible.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや…その片方は、
#. 確かに人間ではないのだが…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No...one side's not human, that's for sure. But...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…とにかく、ボクはその戦いに釘付けになった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Regardless, I couldn't stop staring.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>動く事も、息をする事さえも、
#. 忘れるほどに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I forgot to move, or even breathe...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. オマエ…どういうつもり？
msgctxt "0010 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Why you...! What do you think you're doing?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0011 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 答えろよ…どういうつもりなの？
msgctxt "0012 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I asked you a question! What's the meaning of this?"
msgstr ""

#. ボクに逆らおうなんてさ…
msgctxt "0013 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "How dare you defy me...?"
msgstr ""

#. 約束が違うじゃん！！
msgctxt "0014 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "This wasn't part of the deal!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>約束……？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The deal...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 我は決めたのだ…
msgctxt "0016 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "I've made a decision..."
msgstr ""

#. もう退かぬ、もう媚びぬ、もう省みぬと…
msgctxt "0017 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I will no longer retreat, no longer compromise, no\n"
"longer regret..."
msgstr ""

#. …我は決心したのだ！
msgctxt "0018 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "I've made my decision!"
msgstr ""

#. お前と…戦うと…ッ！！
msgctxt "0019 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "I'm going...to resist you!"
msgstr ""

#. ふーん、あっそ…
msgctxt "0020 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Hmm... Okay."
msgstr ""

#. でもさ…そんな事して、どうなるかわかってるの？
msgctxt "0021 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"But...you do realize what will happen if you go\n"
"through with this, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 忘れちゃった訳じゃないよね？
msgctxt "0022 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "You haven't forgotten, have you?"
msgstr ""

#. 人質の件…！
msgctxt "0023 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "What I'm holding hostage...?"
msgstr ""

#. …ッ！！
msgctxt "0024 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "...!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだ…これ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What am I looking at...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだよ…この会話…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What am I hearing...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>人質って…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A hostage?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>じゃあ…もしかして……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Then...could it be...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕の内通者って……？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The mastermind's spy is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>プレゼント<CLT><CLT 3>“超合金ジャスティスロボ”<CLT><CLT 23>を獲得しました。
#. プレゼントメニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>You received the <CLT><CLT 3>Super Robo Justice<CLT><CLT 23> present.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
